# IPRO7 UVC Camera Application Configuration
#
# Resolution/format are fixed in source (uvc.c descriptor + uvc_isp.h).
# Note: the SDK reads .config directly; Kconfig documents the options but its
# depends/select are not evaluated (see docs/sdk/Configuration_Guide.md).

menu "UVC Camera Configuration"

config UVC_RPS
	bool "Rock-paper-scissors game drawn into the stream (IPRO7AI Reef)"
	depends on IPRO7AI_REEF && AI_SUPPORT
	help
	  Plays rock-paper-scissors against the NPU and draws the game (play
	  box, live label, 3-2-1 countdown, both moves, score) into every
	  640x360 frame the host receives. The classifier, the game logic and
	  the model are the EVK app's (apps/ai/ipro7ai_evk_rps); set
	  RPS_EMBED_MODEL as well to link the model into the image.
	  Build: make -C apps/multimedia/ipro7_uvc_cam DEFCONFIG=defconfig_reef_rps

endmenu
